    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Turtle Riders: Adventure Begins&quot; you will have the chance to see what the main game is about! Take a ride and have a taste of some of the stages, weapons, and modes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-New weapon : Suriken </strong><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-New turtle : Darwin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New reworked endless mode with more enemies and features.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Beast has awakened and the outpost must be warned! To get there you and your giant turtle have to go through 3 big forests filled with enemies and bosses that will attack you on sight. The path is dangerous so pick your weapons of choice and sharpen your aiming skills in this challenging survival adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/ff6de93f82f9ba98e753f3d093d4ba24.webp?t=1741597299\" width=620 height=53 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/12d49ca37ead589cce8c7a60eb4de157.poster.avif?t=1741597299\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/12d49ca37ead589cce8c7a60eb4de157.webm?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/12d49ca37ead589cce8c7a60eb4de157.mp4?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Your aim will be challenged</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/e73ac3090ff80fead4217f46175a4cb7.webp?t=1741597299\" width=620 height=53 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/2c547201a9b13ebd62d3d12d849bd3d0.poster.avif?t=1741597299\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/2c547201a9b13ebd62d3d12d849bd3d0.webm?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/2c547201a9b13ebd62d3d12d849bd3d0.mp4?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>100 unique talents/10 special talents and 5 elemental attacks to make the strongest builds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/da81c5927642f577ddb4d824557f8dff.webp?t=1741597299\" width=620 height=53 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/65c9212c2d0d64f0484546964e224554.poster.avif?t=1741597299\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/65c9212c2d0d64f0484546964e224554.webm?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/65c9212c2d0d64f0484546964e224554.mp4?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Gather orbs to unlock new weapons/turtles and upgrade your stats</strong></p>",
