n class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/e73ac3090ff80fead4217f46175a4cb7.webp?t=1741597299\" width=620 height=53 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/2c547201a9b13ebd62d3d12d849bd3d0.poster.avif?t=1741597299\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/2c547201a9b13ebd62d3d12d849bd3d0.webm?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/2c547201a9b13ebd62d3d12d849bd3d0.mp4?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>100 unique talents/10 special talents and 5 elemental attacks to make the strongest builds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/da81c5927642f577ddb4d824557f8dff.webp?t=1741597299\" width=620 height=53 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/65c9212c2d0d64f0484546964e224554.poster.avif?t=1741597299\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/65c9212c2d0d64f0484546964e224554.webm?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257980/extras/65c9212c2d0d64f0484546964e224554.mp4?t=1741597299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Gather orbs to unlock new weapons/turtles and upgrade your stats</strong></p>",
